From: Onigiri
Subject: [PATCH] Mirror the cover camera preview

On the cover Camera shoots with the rear lenses (0006), which face the user
there, so the preview showed the user unmirrored, unlike a selfie. Mirror it
the way the stock Flip cover camera (QuickShot) and Fold5 rear cam selfie do,
through the preview's mirror mode: pictures and videos still save unflipped.
The flip applies to the camera's buffer, so upright on the cover takes
QuickShot's horizontal one and sideways rear cam selfie's vertical one, and
face boxes, the other overlays and touch focus pair with it the way they do
for those two. Turning between upright and sideways reconnects the camera to
switch, once the preview runs and any capture or recording ends. "Mirror
cover screen preview" under Selfies in Camera settings turns it off. The inner
panel, DeX and pop-up or split screen windows stay unmirrored.

